{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EUQTMqVxPeMFDe6Ve59Ri8","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t\"\"\"Combat system: declare attackers → declare blockers → damage → end combat.\n2\t\n3\tImplements the four substeps of the MTG combat phase:\n4\t\n5\t1. **Declare Attackers** — Active player chooses creatures to attack with.\n6\t   Attackers are tapped (unless they have vigilance).  Creatures with\n7\t   summoning sickness (without haste) or the defender keyword cannot attack.\n8\t\n9\t2. **Declare Blockers** — Defending player assigns blockers.  Creatures\n10\t   with flying can only be blocked by creatures with flying or reach."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"48c64ad6-6cc1-42f5-b9d5-9bf108646c5b","uuid":"96219084-2be9-4091-93c4-bf8e58267612","timestamp":"2026-06-11T13:36:13.024Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/engine/combat.py","content":"\"\"\"Combat system: declare attackers → declare blockers → damage → end combat.\n\nImplements the four substeps of the MTG combat phase:\n\n1. **Declare Attackers** — Active player chooses creatures to attack with.\n   Attackers are tapped (unless they have vigilance).  Creatures with\n   summoning sickness (without haste) or the defender keyword cannot attack.\n\n2. **Declare Blockers** — Defending player assigns blockers.  Creatures\n   with flying can only be blocked by creatures with flying or reach.","numLines":10,"startLine":1,"totalLines":557}}}
